[50.142441, "o", "\u001b[37m```\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;9mcoq\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[37mplus_n_Sm : forall n m : nat, S (n + m) = n + S m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[37m```\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[37mSo\u001b[0m"]
